{
 "manufacturer": "Greenheck",
 "manufacturer_slug": "greenheck",
 "model": "IVE Indoor Energy Recovery Ventilator (BACnet)",
 "model_slug": "ive-energy-recovery-ventilator",
 "aliases": [
  "IVE",
  "Greenheck IVE",
  "IVE_01.002",
  "487690",
  "c.pCO Mini"
 ],
 "equipment_type": "Energy recovery ventilator",
 "applies_to": "Greenheck IVE indoor energy recovery ventilators with the factory c.pCO Mini controller.",
 "summary": "Greenheck's IVE indoor energy recovery units ship with a c.pCO Mini controller that can be licensed for BACnet IP or MS/TP. The BMS mainly enables the unit, commands occupancy, resets alarms and adjusts setpoints; it can also take over fan speeds and push its own sensor values in place of the unit's sensors. A BMS watchdog point must be written regularly or the unit raises an alarm and returns to local control. The points list is the same on every unit, so points for options a unit doesn't have simply won't mean anything.",
 "bacnet_transport": [
  "BACnet IP",
  "BACnet MS/TP"
 ],
 "firmware": null,
 "default_device_instance": null,
 "notes": [
  "BACnet must be licensed/enabled on the controller; without it the unit won't respond.",
  "Write BV-1 BMS_Watchdog = Active regularly; after the timeout (default 15 min) the unit alarms and falls back to local values.",
  "To use a BMS sensor value, set the matching *_Source_BMS binary to BMS, then write the *_from_BMS analog.",
  "Status bits (cooling/heating on, filter alarm, wheel enable, preheat, etc.) are packed into IV-6/8/9/10/11, with 16-bit AV copies for systems that can't read 32-bit integers.",
  "Unit_Status_Mode (AV-40) and LatestAlm (IV-5/AV-93) return codes; the source has the code tables.",
  "This guide is a subset; Greenheck refers to the unit's full BMS points list for detailed alarms and trending."
 ],
 "source": {
  "title": "BACnet Integration Guide for Indoor Ventilator Energy Recovery",
  "doc_number": "Document 487690 (IVE_01.002 Rev 1)",
  "revision_date": "2026-04",
  "url": "https://content.greenheck.com/public/DAMProd/Original/10023/487690_BACnet_iom.pdf"
 },
